Extracted from SGICP, a computational-phenomenology architecture developed
between 2025 and 2026. The mechanism published here — mastery read from
accumulated evidence rather than granted, evidence kinds weighted differently,
a felt gate below which nothing is recorded, discounting of repeated evidence,
and decay of unused fluency while the record itself is preserved — originates
in that work.
